You.

00:21:05.265 --> 00:21:06.558
| didn't know why.

00:21:06.767 --> 00:21:11.646
| didn't understand, so |
thought about it over and over.

00:21:11.855 --> 00:21:15.734
That's when I found the answer.

00:21:15.942 --> 00:21:17.694
| understood.

00:21:36.797 --> 00:21:39.716
Mashiki, I--

00:21:54.314 --> 00:21:55.899
Mashiki?

00:22:00.362 --> 00:22:02.364
Mashiki!

00:22:10.622 --> 00:22:19.130
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.339 --> 00:22:28.974
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:29.182 --> 00:22:37.691
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.899 --> 00:22:46.825
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:47.033 --> 00:22:51.496
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.705 --> 00:22:57.544
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.670 --> 00:23:07.637
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.846 --> 00:23:16.980
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:17.188 --> 00:23:30.744
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.952 --> 00:23:37.292
Call that happiness

